dle;fontColor=#B37E2E;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780" y="700" width="820" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="p31480" name="로드맵"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" page="1" pageWidth="1480" pageHeight="1100" background="none"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;출장에서 설계를 합의하고, 구축 → 병행 운영 → 컷오버 → 고도화 순으로 진행함&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=28;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#614419;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1400" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;0. 협의·설계&lt;/b&gt; — 분리 범위·목표 아키텍처·R&amp;amp;R 합의, 의존성 목록화&lt;br&gt;11/2~11/4 오전 협의 (2.5일)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#614419;strokeColor=#B37E2E;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=22;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="1400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;1. 우시 CI/CD 구축&lt;/b&gt; — Git·Jenkins·Nexus·ArgoCD 설치, 인증·네트워크 연동&lt;br&gt;기간: 11/4 오전 협의에서 확정" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFB343;strokeColor=#B37E2E;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=22;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="310" width="1400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;2. 병행 운영·이관&lt;/b&gt; — Job·레포·이미지 순차 이관, 공용 환경은 롤백용으로 유지&lt;br&gt;기간: 11/4 오전 협의에서 확정" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFB343;strokeColor=#B37E2E;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=22;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="510" width="1400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;3. 컷오버·분리&lt;/b&gt; — 변경 프리즈 후 전환, I 지역 공용 연결·권한 정리&lt;br&gt;기간: 11/4 오전 협의에서 확정" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFB343;strokeColor=#B37E2E;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=22;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="710" width="1400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;4. 고도화 2단계&lt;/b&gt; — 분리 후 개선 항목 (안건 6에서 정한 범위)&lt;br&gt;기간: 컷오버 후 별도 계획" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFB343;strokeColor=#B37E2E;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=22;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="910" width="1400" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#B37E2E;strokeWidth=5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;exitX=0.06;exitY=1;entryX=0.06;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c4" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="게이트: 목표 아키텍처·로드맵 합의 회의록 배포" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#614419;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="150" y="240" width="1000" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#B37E2E;strokeWidth=5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;exitX=0.06;exitY=1;entryX=0.06;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="게이트: 샘플 앱 빌드·배포가 우시 환경만으로 성공" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#614419;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="150" y="440" width="1000" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#B37E2E;strokeWidth=5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;exitX=0.06;exitY=1;entryX=0.06;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="게이트: 이관 대상 전체가 우시에서 성공, 롤백 절차 검증" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#614419;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="150" y="640" width="1000" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#B37E2E;strokeWidth=5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=10;exitX=0.06;exitY=1;entryX=0.06;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="게이트: 컷오버 후 안정화 확인" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#614419;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="150" y="840" width="1000" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>